            "review_title": "Review at Local Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Hưng D\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n1\nDrinking Golf Beer craft beer is absolutely delicious!\nAug 2026 • Friends\nThe craft beer is absolutely delicious! The hop aroma and flavor are rich and distinctive, making it feel like a completely different experience from regular canned beer. The owners are incredibly friendly, and the atmosphere is great. A must-visit spot in the heart of An Hải, right in Da Nang’s vibrant coastal tourist area!\n\nクラフトビールが本当に美味しい！ホップの香りと風味がしっかりしていて、一般的な缶ビールとは別格です。オーナーご夫妻もとても親切で雰囲気も最高。アナハイの中心、ダナンの海沿い観光エリアでぜひ立ち寄りたい一軒です！\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nCraft beer pairs perfectly with grilled meat\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 21, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
