            "review_title": "Review at Local Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Đỗ Trung\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGood Orginal Local Craft Beer\nJun 2026 • Business\nI have been here and experienced the beer brewed and fermented for a long time in Vietnam, but it especially shows the originality of classic beers like pilsner, IPA, and stout from European countries, the U.S., and other countries famous for craft beer. I will come to drink and relax.\nInsider tip:\nIf you’re someone who likes light beer, go for Pilsner Alc4,5%, IBU15 if your style is strong beer, you should try IPA Alc 6,0%, IBU50.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 1, 2026",
